# .TELNET to a host name that does not resolve puts the machine back and
# returns the ESP's error, which tools/telnet-probe.lua reads ("DNS Fail").
# The line after it does not run. Real speed: the ESP asks the Mac's DNS.
# No noreset line: NextZXOS runs from $0000 when ON ERROR traps an error.
put @DOTS@/TELNET.DOT /dot/TELNET
autostart ON ERROR ERROR TO e,l:POKE 23692,255:PRINT "ERR ";e;" ";l:FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0:NEXT i
autostart .TELNET nosuch.invalid
autostart POKE 23692,255:PRINT "AFTER"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0:NEXT i
seconds 30
screen 29 ERR 255
